Licences of the components in wine.app

Each component, its licence, where its licence texts are in this bundle, and where its source is. SOURCE (beside this
file) names the exact inputs this bundle was built from: upstream commits, and the hash of the MacNeutron patch series
applied to each tree ("dev" for a tree built with unexported work). The patches and pins are in the MacNeutron
repository (https://github.com/chadouming/MacNeutron), at the commit SOURCE's MACNEUTRON_COMMIT names. NOTICES.md
quotes the notices that live only in source headers. Not legal advice.

Wine 11.19 (the loader, wineserver, Wine's libraries and programs)
  Licence: LGPL-2.1-or-later. Texts: wine/LICENSE, wine/COPYING.LIB, wine/AUTHORS; Wine's vendored libraries are
  listed in wine/NOTICES.md, and GSM (wine/gsm-COPYRIGHT) and FAudio (zlib licence, wine/faudio-LICENSE) carry their
  own texts.
  Source: https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine.git at WINE_COMMIT (tag wine-11.19), with the patches in the
  repository's wine-arm64/patches/wine (pinned in wine-arm64/pins).

FEX (libarm64ecfex.dll and libarm64ecfex.so: runs x86_64 code)
  Licence: MIT, fex/LICENSE; MacNeutron's patches to it are MIT too. Compiled-in externals, each with its text in
  fex/: fmt (MIT), xxhash (BSD-2-Clause), tiny-json (MIT), unordered_dense (MIT), rpmalloc (0BSD), cephes (BSD),
  range-v3 (Boost Software Licence 1.0), cpp-optparse (MIT). SoftFloat-3e (BSD-3-Clause), the VIXL utilities
  (BSD-3-Clause), musl and Arm's routines (MIT) and Madeira's patches (MIT grant): NOTICES.md.
  Source: https://github.com/FEX-Emu/FEX.git at FEX_COMMIT with its submodules at the FEX_SUBMODULE_* commits, and
  the patches in the repository's wine-arm64/patches/fex (pinned in wine-arm64/pins).

DXMT (the Direct3D to Metal DLLs in ../DXMT/aarch64-windows, winemetal.dll and winemetal.so)
  Licence: LGPL-2.1-or-later. Texts: ../DXMT/LICENSE, ../DXMT/COPYING.LIB, ../DXMT/LICENSE.OLD (MIT, for releases up
  to v0.80). DXBCParser (MIT, Microsoft) and the constexpr GUID parser (MIT): NOTICES.md.
  Source: https://github.com/chadouming/dxmt.git at DXMT_COMMIT (../DXMT/version names it too), with the patches
  in the repository's wine-arm64/patches/dxmt (pinned in dxmt/pins).

LLVM 15.0.7 (linked statically into winemetal.so)
  Licence: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, llvm/LICENSE.TXT; its regular-expression code, llvm/COPYRIGHT.regex;
  ConvertUTF (Unicode, Inc.) and the regex notice: NOTICES.md.
  Source: https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project.git at LLVM_TAG (llvmorg-15.0.7), unmodified.

llvm-mingw 20260908 (the Windows-side toolchain: DXMT's DLLs, winemetal.dll and libarm64ecfex.dll link its runtime)
  Licence: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, llvm-mingw/LICENSE.TXT; the mingw-w64 runtime,
  llvm-mingw/COPYING.MinGW-w64-runtime.txt.
  Source: https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-mingw/releases/download/20260908/llvm-mingw-20260908-ucrt-macos-universal.tar.xz
  (SHA-256 LLVM_MINGW_SHA256, pinned in dxmt/pins); the sources it is built from are listed at
  https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-mingw.

